# Throwaway drivers.
#
# The specs live in tests/ and are run by the runner. What this catches is the
# other thing: a one-off script written at the repo root to drive the built app
# through a browser and look at the result, because the app publishes its store
# and its projector in dev and that is the fastest way to check a change by
# eye. They are written, run, and deleted - and one of them was not, and rode
# into a commit.
*.tmp.mjs
